Fengxi Taskboard

This software contains and modifies code from Codex Taskboard / dashi-taskboard
by chuspeeism and its contributors, based on upstream v1.1.27.
Upstream source: https://github.com/chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard/tree/v1.1.27
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0, included in LICENSE.

Fengxi modifications include execution-state and review adapters, task identity
and recovery handling, multi-entry client support, Fengxi branding, portable
runtime defaults, and source-distribution documentation.
See docs/FENGXI-CHANGES.md for the scope of this distribution.

